    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "Hello! I wanted to ask if there's already functionality to only search within scope using mini.indentscope's API. I was hoping to pass current scope's lines into [fzf-lua](https://github.com/ibhagwan/fzf-lua) and search only within that scope. I couldn't quite figure it out. I did fine `require('mini.indentscope').get_scope()` function that I can use but it did not return what I thought it would. Thanks!",
